WEBVTT

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:20.500
Shugo Amihama. Ranked 3rd in last year's
junior high 100-meter freestyle.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.380
But...

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.250
It looks like he joined track.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.130
Huh?

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:33.720
How can that be?! Someone he went to
school with told me he'd join for sure!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.770
We're the closest thing to a swim club!

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.020
Beats me.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.270
Let's ask your second choice.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.150
No can do!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.020
I assumed he'd join, so I don't have one!

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.610
Eh?!

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:57.080
All right. If you'd like to join,
just submit this form.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.200
Why do I have to?!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.710
Thanks to your water polo fame,
he might know you.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.840
I wonder...

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:08.170
I'll do it! I'll force the dude to join!

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:11.300
U-Uh, we don't wanna start a brawl.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.090
He's coming this way!

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.180
Work your magic!

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.270
W-Wait! Whoa! Whoa!

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.610
Um, hello.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:25.980
Oh, you're...

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.110
Ooh! He knows him!

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.570
He's that famous?

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:31.450
We'll discuss that later.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:33.030
Huh? Have we met--?

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.370
You're in my class, right?

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.030
Huh?

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.740
Huh?

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.000
Class 1-B.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.660
Ah! Yeah, yeah!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.540
Is he, really?

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.500
What the hell?!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.210
Need something?

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:53.340
Y-Yeah. I heard you're good
at swimming, Amihama.

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:54.470
And?

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:55.550
Huh?

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.680
The rumors were right.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:58.850
Rumors?

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:03.810
He's stoic and shows no emotion.
Nobody saw him laugh in junior high.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:07.360
That's how he got
the nickname "The Mask."

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.860
Is that why you didn't wanna talk to him?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.200
Yup. Bingo.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:19.410
Um, I'll get straight to the point.
The water polo--

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.580
No thanks.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:21.830
Huh?

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:29.750
H-Hold on. Is it 'cuz you're joining
track? You like it that much?

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:36.390
No. I'll try kendo tomorrow, and then
archery. I'll decide once I've tried 'em.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:39.720
Huh? Then why don't you try water polo--?!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.640
I'm not swimming again.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.980
Huh?

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.350
I have no reason to swim now.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.190
Oy! Why won't he swim again? Why?!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.450
How would we know?

00:02:54.450 --> 00:03:00.330
For him to refuse this strongly...
This might be hopeless!

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:38.760
We can't play without seven people...

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:40.420
Episode 3:          But, Give Us a Hendy

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:41.800
I can't be Okayama's
best without playing...

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.810
And if I'm not Okayama's best...

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.180
Then, dish out the money!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:57.940
What's his deal? Why would a
national-level athlete quit? An injury?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.740
Amihama.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.110
Sure.

